          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从 JSON 备份恢复记录；同一古迹以导入值覆盖，其余保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restore records from a JSON backup. Entries for the same monument are replaced by the imported ones; everything else is kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JSON バックアップから記録を復元します。同じ古跡の記録は読み込んだ内容で上書きし、それ以外は保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从任意圆点开始" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start from any dot"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どの点からでも始められます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从汉阙到层叠殿阁，石与木记下漫长岁月。亲见的盖上印记，向往的收入心愿；一部慢慢写满的古迹图鉴。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From Han-dynasty que gates to tiered halls, stone and timber hold the long passage of time. Stamp a seal on the places you have seen, keep the ones you long for on your wishlist — a field guide to monuments, filled in slowly."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漢代の闕から幾重にも連なる殿閣まで、石と木が長い歳月を刻んできました。訪れた場所には印を押し、憧れの場所は「行きたい」に。少しずつ埋めていく古跡図鑑です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以细线描的笔意，记下走过与向往的古迹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fine line drawings of the monuments you have visited and long to see."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "細い線描の筆致で、訪れた古跡と憧れの古跡を記す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置约略，距离仅供参考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your location is approximate; distances are only a guide."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位置はおおよそのため、距離は目安です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "佛光寺东大殿 · 柱头铺作" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "East Hall of Foguang Temple · Column-top bracket set"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仏光寺東大殿 · 柱頭組物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "佛光寺东大殿柱头铺作 · 线稿" : {
