    "另有 %lld 处未在图中列出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "+ %lld more not shown"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ほか%lld件は図に載せていません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对登记了本体坐标的 %lld 处古迹提醒，范围 3 公里，同一处每天最多一次。位置只在本机比较距离，不保存，也不进入备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reminders cover only the %lld monuments with coordinates recorded for the monument itself, within 3 km, at most once a day for each. Your location is compared on this device only; it is never saved or backed up."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建物自体の座標が登録された%lld件の古跡だけを対象に、3km以内で、同じ場所は1日1回まで通知します。位置はこの端末内で距離の比較に使うだけで、保存もバックアップもされません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只展示已经到访的地方，点选地名细读古迹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only places you have visited are shown. Tap a place name to read about its monuments."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "訪れた場所だけを表示します。地名をタップすると古跡を詳しく見られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名录与线路 · 看看集齐了多少" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Canons and routes · See how many you've collected"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名録とルート · どれだけ制覇したか"
          }
        }
      }
