    "向下 · 从一攒斗拱开始" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scroll down · Begin with a single bracket set"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下へ · ひと組の斗栱から"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "向右拖到底并松手，将保存今天的到访日期；也可使用记录今日到访操作" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag all the way to the right and let go to save today as the visit date, or use the Record today's visit action."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "右端までドラッグして指を離すと、今日の日付で訪問を保存します。「今日の訪問を記録」の操作も使えます。"
          }
        }
